    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Morgan Johnson is one of Londons finest police detectives. As his partner dies while investigating a strange case of murder, he finds himself blamed. Demoted and removed from the case, Morgan is assigned a new partner: Jack Brown, a young officer notorious for his loose interpretation of the rules. Worst of all, for their first job together, they\u2019re told to find a missing dog. For Morgan, things couldn\u2019t be worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But when the seemingly innocuous case turns up and unusual clue, Morgan and Jack find themselves on the edge of a dark conspiracy brewing in the shadows\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A conspiracy that threatens London itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\tThrilling and unusual cases to solve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\tFun match-3 puzzles to test your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\tUnique characters across the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\t5 chapters and a single story connecting them all</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\t20 upgrades to unlock </p>",
